<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR 96 NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR 96 NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.02 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.03 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.09 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Sales		    0.92 vs   0.64</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.66 vs   0.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.14 vs   0.48</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.75 vs   0.79</p>
<p> Sales		   13.96 vs  12.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish leather company is Chemiskor SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
